        <a class="sm-item" href="reversal-study.html" target="_blank"><span class="sm-item-name">↩️ Reversal-Point Research</span><span class="sm-item-desc">A SEPARATE calc from the vol forecast: extracts where price ACTUALLY reverses intraday (swings that held) and measures them vs the London-open + the running extreme. Shows, per pair, whether reversals cluster before/at/past the median range — the empirical exhaustion distance, split dominant vs minor + median/75th zone occupancy</span></a>
